","text":"*Quake* (3-turn recharge): a 300 ft area takes 12d10 and everyone is knocked prone.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":["12d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Set piece","text":"*Set piece*."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: it acts three times a round."},{"name":"Countdown (10) – Waking","text":"*Countdown (10) – Waking*: once disturbed, after 10 rounds it fully wakes and starts moving towards the surface."}],"harvest":"Scales (legendary earth core).","role":"Set piece","wants":"To sleep.","tactics":"The fight is about getting it back to sleep before the countdown ends, not killing it.","tell":"the earth moans.","exploit":"old rituals of the deep peoples soothe it.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":10,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Waking"}],"shifts":[]},"order":23},{"id":"gustling","name":"Gustling","kr":1,"volume":2,"family":"Sky and Storm","familyId":"sky-and-storm","typeLine":"Beast, flier","tags":["flier"],"type":"Beast","description":"A sparrow-sized bird made mostly of feathers and wind. Flocks of them pick pockets.","hp":6,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"10 ft, fly 60 ft","stats":{"str":18,"dex":3,"con":14,"int":15,"wis":9,"cha":13},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":8,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Snatch","text":"*Snatch*: steals one small item (DEX save to hold on).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Gust","text":"*Gust*: anything it flies past is buffeted (disadvantage on its next ranged attack)."}],"harvest":"Wind feathers (fletching that never drifts).","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Shiny things.","tactics":"Flocks dive through the party, stealing.","tell":"a sudden breeze on a still day.","exploit":"drop something shinier as a decoy.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":24},{"id":"razorw