cks and laughs when its prey stumbles.","hp":24,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":6,"con":10,"int":15,"wis":8,"cha":13},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":12,"disengage":9,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 1d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Kick Dust","text":"*Kick Dust*: a creature next to it is blinded for 1 turn (DEX save).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Pack Hunter","text":"*Pack Hunter*."},{"name":"Mockery","text":"*Mockery*: when an ally of the pack misses, the pack laughs and that creature makes a WIS save or has disadvantage on its next attack."}],"harvest":"Pelt.","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Carrion, ideally fresh.","tactics":"Kicks dust, bites the blinded, and laughs at misses.","tell":"yipping from the dunes.","exploit":"they flee if the leader (biggest one) drops.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":50},{"id":"saltcrust-beetle","name":"Saltcrust Beetle","kr":5,"volume":2,"family":"Dunes and Wastes","familyId":"dunes-and-wastes","typeLine":"Beast","tags":[],"type":"Beast","description":"A beetle as big as a dog with a crust of white salt on its back. It sprays brine that dries you out.","hp":44,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":2,"speed":"30 ft, burrow 15 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":14,"con":7,"int":19,"wis":12,"cha":19},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":8,"dodge":17,"disengage":16,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Mandibles","text":"Mandibles: 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Brine Spray","text":"*Brine Spray* (2-turn recharge): a 15 ft cone, 2d6, and targets gain 1 level of thirst (disadvantage on CON saves until they drink).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["2d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Salt Shell","text":"*Salt Shell*: water poured on it dissolves the crust (Defence 0)."}],"harvest":"Salt (preserves anything), shell.","role":"Controller","wants":"Moisture.","tactics":"Dries out a group, then picks off the thirstiest.","tell":"its back steams in the sun.","exploit":"water ruins its armour.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":51},{"id":"mirage-cat","name":"Mirage Cat","kr":7,"volume":2,"family":"Dunes and Wastes","familyId":"dunes-and-wastes","typeLine":"Beast","tags":[],"type":"Beast","description":"A sand-coloured cat that bends the heat haze around itself. You see three of it, and none are in the right place.","hp":60,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":1,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":10,"dex":4,"con":9,"int":14,"wis":7,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws 1d8 and Bite 1d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8","1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Mirage","text":"*Mirage*: it has two mirage copies. Each attack against it hits a random one of the three. A copy disappears when hit. Copies come back at the start of its turn in sunlight."}],"harvest":"Pelt (a cloak that blurs the wearer in heat).","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"To eat without a fight.","tactics":"Attacks from the haze while the copies soak hits.","tell":"three sets of eyes, but only one set of tracks.","exploit":"look at the tracks. Shade or night stops copies coming back.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":52},{"id":"sun-eater-vulture","name":"Sun-eater Vulture","kr":11,"volume":2,"family":"Dunes and Wastes","familyId":"dunes-and-wastes","typeLine":"Beast, flier","tags":["flier"],"type":"Beast","description":"A huge, bald vulture whose shadow b