","exploit":"the noise of its own avalanches confuses it, so loud echoes from bells draw it off.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":66},{"id":"frostbloom","name":"Frostbloom","kr":26,"volume":2,"family":"The Frostlands","familyId":"the-frostlands","typeLine":"Plant","tags":[],"type":"Plant","description":"A huge crystal flower that grows from frozen corpses. Its pollen freezes lungs and plants new seeds.","hp":220,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"0 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":20,"con":3,"int":14,"wis":8,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":5,"dodge":20,"disengage":null,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Thorn Lash","text":"Thorn Lash: reach 20 ft, 3d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Pollen Burst","text":"*Pollen Burst* (2-turn recharge): everyone within 40 ft makes a CON save or gains +2d2 frost.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"frost"}]},{"name":"Seed","text":"*Seed*: a creature frozen solid by its pollen grows a Frostbloom seedling (minion) in 1d4 rounds.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Countdown (6) – Bloom","text":"*Countdown (6) – Bloom*: after 6 rounds it fully blooms, and the Pollen Burst becomes every turn."},{"name":"Weak Point – Root-corpse (40 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Root-corpse (40 HP)*: breaking it kills the plant."}],"harvest":"Crystal petals (a cold-school reagent).","role":"Controller","wants":"More corpses.","tactics":"Freezes the party and turns them into a garden.","tell":"the air glitters with pollen.","exploit":"the root-corpse is the plant's anchor; dig for it.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Root-corpse","hp":40,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[{"trait":0,"count":6,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Bloom"}