 The Answer*: when the calculation finishes, something happens. The GM decides what."}],"harvest":"The calculation (whoever reads it knows one great secret).","role":"Set piece","wants":"To finish counting.","tactics":"This is a dungeon that fights back. The party chooses: stop the calculation, or let it finish and see what it says.","tell":"every clock in the region shows the same wrong time.","exploit":"the clerks and scribes inside will help if they're shown proper paperwork.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Five Escapements","hp":250,"each":true,"count":5}],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":10,"unit":"rounds","effect":"The Answer"}],"shifts":[]},"order":97},{"id":"gravecrawler","name":"Gravecrawler","kr":1,"volume":2,"family":"The Restless Dead","familyId":"the-restless-dead","typeLine":"Undead","tags":[],"type":"Undead","description":"The top half of a corpse, dragging itself out of a shallow grave by its fingernails.","hp":10,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"15 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":17,"con":10,"int":20,"wis":15,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":17,"disengage":16,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Grasp","text":"Grasp: 1d6, and the target is grabbed by the ankle.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Undead","text":"*Undead*."},{"name":"Low","text":"*Low*: it's prone all the time, so ranged attacks against it have disadvantage."}],"harvest":"Nothing worth taking.","role":"Minion","wants":"To pull someone down into its grave.","tactics":"Grabs ankles while bigger dead attack.","tell":"the earth moves in a graveyard.","exploit":"it's slow, so just walk away.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":98},{"id":"lampwight","name":"Lampwight","kr":2,"volume":2,"family":"The Restless Dead","familyId":"the-restless-dead","typeLine":"Undead, incorporeal"