sage to its chest.","exploit":"let it pass, and you'll owe nothing. The message is usually a hook.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":0,"part":"Glass wings","hp":20,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":139},{"id":"halo-serpent","name":"Halo Serpent","kr":16,"volume":2,"family":"Lightborn","familyId":"lightborn","typeLine":"Light beast","tags":[],"type":"Light beast","description":"A serpent of white light that forms a ring and spins. Anything inside the ring is held still.","hp":135,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"40 ft, fly 40 ft","stats":{"str":7,"dex":5,"con":6,"int":14,"wis":7,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 2d10 light.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Halo","text":"*Halo* (2-turn recharge): it forms a ring around a creature, who makes a WIS save or is paralysed. Two failed saves in a row and they're held until the serpent dies.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Bright","text":"*Bright*: it sheds bright light for 60 ft, so nothing can hide near it."}],"harvest":"Halo coil (a ring that holds anything put through it still).","role":"Controller","wants":"Order, and stillness.","tactics":"Rings the most active creature and bites the others.","tell":"it coils, glowing brighter.","exploit":"dark magic dims it (disadvantage on its next Halo).","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":140},{"id":"dawnwarden","name":"Dawnwarden","kr":22,"volume":2,"family":"Lightborn","familyId":"lightborn","typeLine":"Construct, light","tags":["light"],"type":"Construct","description":"A guardian of white stone with a lantern of captured dawn in its chest. It was set to guard something holy, and it doesn't negotiate.","hp":190,"hpNote":