ants":"To keep singing. It doesn't know it's hurting anyone.","tactics":"It's peaceful until attacked, and the town can't wake up while it sings.","tell":"everyone in town wakes up humming the same tune.","exploit":"dream logic. Change the dream so it swims away.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":155},{"id":"morrow-sleeper","name":"Morrow-Sleeper","kr":100,"volume":2,"family":"Dreamborn","familyId":"dreamborn","typeLine":"Giant, dreaming","tags":["dreaming"],"type":"Giant","description":"A giant asleep under a hill. Its dream is the town on top of the hill. If it wakes, the town ends.","hp":900,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":10,"speed":"40 ft (if awake)","stats":{"str":1,"dex":15,"con":1,"int":6,"wis":3,"cha":5},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":17,"disengage":15,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Asleep","text":"*Asleep*: Dream Shift, three times a round, one creature in the town is moved, changed or rewritten by the dream (WIS save).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]},{"name":"Awake","text":"*Awake*: Fist ×2, 6d12 each.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["6d12"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"Shift (Asleep/Waking)","text":"*Shift (Asleep/Waking)*: it starts asleep."},{"name":"Countdown (5) – Waking","text":"*Countdown (5) – Waking*: violence in the town ticks the countdown. At 0 it wakes; the town and everyone in it who isn't real fades."}],"harvest":"Its dream (whoever takes it can dream anything into being, once).","role":"Solo","wants":"To sleep forever.","tactics":"The party must fix the dream from inside without waking it.","tell":"the townsfolk can't remember their own pasts.","exploit":"a lullaby, sung by someone real, adds 1 to the countdown.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":5,"unit":"ro