,"text":"*Ageless*: it doesn't age, and it can't be slowed or hastened."}],"harvest":"Its fang (an ageing reagent; wine makers love it).","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Years to eat.","tactics":"Bites and runs.","tell":"the grass where it walks turns brown.","exploit":"the years come back if it's killed within a day.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":159},{"id":"stutterling","name":"Stutterling","kr":8,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Aberration","tags":[],"type":"Aberration","description":"A small, flickering thing that's slightly out of step with time. There always seem to be two of it.","hp":66,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":1,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":11,"dex":4,"con":9,"int":9,"wis":9,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Claw","text":"Claw: 2d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Stutter","text":"*Stutter*: it takes two turns a round, at two different initiative counts, but its HP is shared. On its second turn it repeats exactly what it did on its first, against the same target if it can."}],"harvest":"A stutter-gland (lets you replay the last second of a sound).","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"To catch up with itself.","tactics":"Predictable on its second turn.","tell":"you saw it do that a moment ago.","exploit":"move away after its first turn, so its repeat attack hits nothing.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":160},{"id":"hourglass-golem","name":"Hourglass Golem","kr":12,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Construct, timeworn","tags":["timeworn"],"type":"Construct","description":"A golem with a huge hourglass for a body. When the sand runs out, it turns itself over, and everything in the room is reset.","hp":105,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"25 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":14,"con":4,"int":15,"wis":9,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Glass Fists ×2, 2d8 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Construct","text":"*Construct*."},{"name":"Countdown (4) – Turn Over","text":"*Countdown (4) – Turn Over*: at 0, everything in the room goes back to how it was 4 rounds ago: HP, positions, used spells. Only the golem keeps its damage."},{"name":"Weak Point – Glass (30 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Glass (30 HP)*: breaking it ends the countdown and the sand spills out."}],"harvest":"Time-sand (a time-school legendary reagent).","role":"Hazard","wants":"To keep the room as it was.","tactics":"It resets the fight unless you break its glass.","tell":"the sand is visibly running out.","exploit":"the reset doesn't heal the golem. Hit it hard, and break the glass before the timer.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Glass","hp":30,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[{"trait":1,"count":4,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Turn Over"}],"shifts":[]},"order":161},{"id":"yesterdays-echo","name":"Yesterday's Echo","kr":18,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Timeworn","tags":[],"type":"Timeworn","description":"A ghostly copy of the party as they were yesterday, still angry about whatever happened then.","hp":150,"hpNote":"total (split equally between one copy per party member)","defence":null,"defenceText":"as the originals","minHit":3,"speed":null,"stats":null,"statsText":"as the originals were a day ago.","combat":null,"combatOrder":[],"combatText":"as the originals, but 1 worse in each.","attacks":[{"name":null,"text":"Each copy has the attacks its original had yesterday, at half damage.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Echoes","text":"*Echoes*: a copy knows everything its original knew yesterday, but nothing since."},{"name":"Shared Fate","text":"*Shared Fate*: damage to a copy doesn't hurt its original, but healing a copy heals the original too."}],"harvest":"None. They fade.","role":"Mirror","wants":"To finish yesterday's fight.","tactics":"You fight yourselves.","tell":"you hear your own voices arguing in the next room.","exploit":"use whatever you learned today.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":162},{"id":"epoch-tortoise","name":"Epoch Tortoise","kr":26,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Beast, timeworn","tags":["timeworn"],"type":"Beast","description":"An ancient tortoise that moves in its own time. Sometimes it's slow as stone; sometimes the world around it is the slow one.","hp":220,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":5,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":16,"con":2,"int":12,"wis":4,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":18,"disengage":17,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 4d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Shell Slam","text":"*Shell Slam*: everyone within 10 ft takes 3d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Shift (Slow/Fast)","text":"*Shift (Slow/Fast)*: it switches every round."},{"name":"Slow","text":"*Slow*: it gets no turn, but everything within 60 ft of it gets an extra action."},{"name":"Fast","text":"*Fast*: it gets three turns, and everything within 60 ft is slowed (half speed, one action)."}],"harvest":"Shell (a time-school legendary shield).","role":"Hazard","wants":"To live forever.","tactics":"Its Fast rounds are deadly, but its Slow rounds give you all extra turns.","tell":"it blinks before each switch.","exploit":"save your big moves for its Slow rounds.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":0,"modes":["Slow","Fast"]}]},"order":163},{"id":"paradox-hound","name":"Paradox Hound","kr":36,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Timeworn","tags":[],"type":"Timeworn","description":"A hound that bites you before it attacks. The wound appears first; the hound catches up later.","hp":300,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":5,"speed":"60 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":3,"con":4,"int":10,"wis":4,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":9,"disengage":5,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite ×2, 3d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Future Bite","text":"*Future Bite*: at the start of combat, it chooses one target and declares one Bite. That Bite lands in round 3, wherever the target is, unless the target kills the hound first.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Always Arrives","text":"*Always Arrives*: it can't be prevented from reaching a target it has bitten in the future (it appears next to them)."}],"harvest":"Paradox fang (a legendary time core).","role":"Solo","wants":"To catch the one it's already bitten.","tactics":"It hunts its declared target across time.","tell":"a bite mark appears before you see the hound.","exploit":"it's predictable. You know who it's coming for.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":164},{"id":"chronophage","name":"Chronophage","kr":60,"volume":2,"family":"Timeworn","familyId":"timeworn","typeLine":"Aberration, timeworn","tags":["timeworn"],"type":"Aberration","description":"A creature that eats time. Whole moments vanish when it feeds, and people lose turns, hours or years.","hp":510,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,