nter's worth of cloth).","role":"Controller","wants":"Her flock safe from wolves, and thieves.","tactics":"Hooks people into the path of her rams.","tell":"a whistle echoing off the crags.","exploit":"she's been losing sheep to something. Help her and she'll help you.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":211},{"id":"tidewader","name":"Tidewader","kr":30,"volume":2,"family":"Giants and Titanfolk","familyId":"giants-and-titanfolk","typeLine":"Giant","tags":[],"type":"Giant","description":"A sea-giant who wades through bays waist-deep, fishing with nets as big as villages. Sometimes the nets catch boats.","hp":260,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":5,"speed":"40 ft, swim 40 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":13,"con":3,"int":14,"wis":8,"cha":13},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":6,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Fist 3d10 and Harpoon, range 60 ft, 3d10 (pulled 30 ft).","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10","3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Net Cast","text":"*Net Cast* (2-turn recharge): a 30 ft area, everyone is restrained (STR save; the net has 30 HP).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"At Home in Water","text":"*At Home in Water*: in water, it has advantage on attacks."}],"harvest":"Its net (a legendary net), harpoon.","role":"Controller","wants":"A good catch.","tactics":"Nets the party and pulls them into the sea.","tell":"a huge net hanging in the shallows.","exploit":"it's fishing, not fighting. Show it a better fishing spot.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":212},{"id":"cloudhauler","name":"Cloudhauler","kr":40,"volume":2,"family":"Giants and Titanfolk","familyId":"giants-and-titanfolk","typeLine":"Giant","tags":[],"type":"Giant","description":"A giant who walks on mountaintops, pulli