une Flare* (2-turn recharge): one of its runes flares, see below.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Weak Points – Four Runes (40 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Four Runes (40 HP each)*: *Fire* (6d10 fire in a 30 ft cone), *Stone* (Min hit +4), *Command* (it must obey whoever holds the rune-key), *Wrath* (+2d10 damage). Each rune broken ends its effect."}],"harvest":"Broken runes (legendary reagents in their flavours).","role":"Solo","wants":"To be free.","tactics":"Someone holds the rune-key and is using it.","tell":"the runes glow before each flare.","exploit":"break the Command rune first, and the giant will fight for you.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Four Runes","hp":40,"each":true,"count":4}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":214},{"id":"stormbrow-titan","name":"Stormbrow Titan","kr":100,"volume":2,"family":"Giants and Titanfolk","familyId":"giants-and-titanfolk","typeLine":"Giant","tags":[],"type":"Giant","description":"A titan with a beard of thunderclouds who strides between mountain peaks. Wherever he argues, there are storms.","hp":900,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":10,"speed":"60 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":10,"con":1,"int":6,"wis":4,"cha":5},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Fist ×2, 5d12 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Thunderclap","text":"*Thunderclap* (3-turn recharge): everything within 120 ft takes 8d10 lightning and is deafened.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":["8d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Lightning Hurl","text":"*Lightning Hurl* (×1): range 300 ft, 6d10 lightning, +1d2 stun.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"×1","damage":["6d10"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"stun"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: he acts twice a round."},{"name":"Weak Point – Beard (150 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Beard (150 HP)*: cutting it ends Thunderclap and Lightning Hurl."}],"harvest":"A lock of beard (a legendary lightning core).","role":"Solo","wants":"To win an argument with another titan.","tactics":"He isn't fighting you; you're in the way of his argument.","tell":"thunder that sounds like shouting.","exploit":"settle the argument and the storm stops.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Beard","hp":150,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":215},{"id":"the-earthshaper","name":"The Earthshaper","kr":160,"volume":2,"family":"Giants and Titanfolk","familyId":"giants-and-titanfolk","typeLine":"Titan","tags":[],"type":"Titan","description":"One of the titans who shaped the land. She sculpts mountains with her hands, and she's decided this valley needs a lake.","hp":1450,"hpNote":null,"defence":6,"minHit":11,"speed":"60 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":14,"con":1,"int":3,"wis":2,"cha":4},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":17,"disengage":15,"casting":2},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Shaping Hands ×2, 5d20 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d20"],"status":[]},{"name":"Reshape","text":"*Reshape* (3-turn recharge): a 120 ft area of land rises or falls 60 ft. Creatures there fall or are buried.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: she acts three times a round."},{"name":"Creation","text":"*Creation*: she uses the creation flavour."},{"name":"Countdown (8) – Lake","text":"*Countdown (8) – Lake*: at 0, the valley is flooded."}],"harvest":"Her chisel (a god-tier earth core, if she gives it).","role":"Solo","wants":"A beautiful landscape.","tactics":"She's not malicious, just making art.","tell":"the mountains around the valley have moved overnight.","exploit":"convince her the valley is already beautiful. A gift of art works.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":3,"count":8,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Lake"}],"shifts":[]},"order":216},{"id":"the-unmade-titan","name":"The Unmade Titan","kr":300,"volume":2,"family":"Giants and Titanfolk","familyId":"giants-and-titanfolk","typeLine":"Titan","tags":[],"type":"Titan","description":"The last titan of destruction, sealed under the world in the first age. The seals are breaking, and it remembers who put it there.","hp":2800,"hpNote":null,"defence":6,"minHit":14,"speed":"60 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":10,"con":1,"int":2,"wis":1,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":11,"casting":1},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Unmaking Fist ×2, 8d20 destruction each, and Stomp, a 60 ft area, 10d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["8d20","10d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Undo","text":"*Undo* (3-turn recharge): a 300 ft area is unmade. Everything there makes a CHA save or is destroyed.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Set piece","text":"*Set piece*."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: it acts four times a round."},{"name":"Destruction","text":"*Destruction*: it uses the destruction flavour."},{"name":"Weak Points – Seven Seals (350 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Seven Seals (350 HP each)*: reversed, these are its prison. Repairing a seal (a ritual, three rounds) chains one limb and removes one action."},{"name":"Countdown (12) – Freedom","text":"*Countdown (12) – Freedom*: at 0, it's free."}],"harvest":"None. It can only be sealed again.","role":"Set piece","wants":"Revenge on the world.","tactics":"The party can't kill it. They have to reseal it.","tell":"earthquakes in a perfect ring around the seals.","exploit":"the Earthshaper sealed it the first time. She'll help, if asked properly.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":3,"part":"Seven Seals","hp":350,"each":true,"count":7}],"countdowns":[{"trait":4,"count":12,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Freedom"}],"shifts":[]},"order":217},{"id":"driftling","name":"Driftling","kr":3,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A small, glowing jellyfish that floats through the air, drifting in from somewhere else. Its sting sends you a short way sideways.","hp":20,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"fly 20 ft (hover)","stats":{"str":18,"dex":9,"con":12,"int":18,"wis":10,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":11,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Sting","text":"Sting: 1d8, and the target is teleported 15 ft in a random direction.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Drifting","text":"*Drifting*: it moves with the wind, and can pass through walls."}],"harvest":"Drift-jelly (a teleportation reagent).","role":"Nuisance","wants":"To drift home.","tactics":"It isn't hunting; it's drifting into people.","tell":"soft blue lights floating against the breeze.","exploit":"step aside.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":218},{"id":"threshold-cat","name":"Threshold Cat","kr":5,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar beast","tags":[],"type":"Planar beast","description":"A grey cat that lives in doorways between worlds. Every door it walks through goes somewhere else.","hp":38,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":4,"con":11,"int":10,"wis":6,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Claws","text":"Claws: 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Wrong Door","text":"*Wrong Door* (2-turn recharge): a creature walking through a doorway within 30 ft ends up through a different one within 300 ft.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Doorwalker","text":"*Doorwalker*: it can step through any door and come out of any other door within a mile."}],"harvest":"None. Anyone who harms one has bad luck with doors.","role":"Trickster","wants":"A warm doorway.","tactics":"Splits the party through doorways.","tell":"a cat sitting in the frame, watching.","exploit":"feed it and it'll open the right door.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":219},{"id":"mirrorfolk-scout","name":"Mirrorfolk Scout","kr":8,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A visitor from a world behind the mirrors. It looks like you, but backwards, and it's here to learn your weaknesses.","hp":68,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":2,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":10,"dex":7,"con":8,"int":7,"wis":7,"cha":7},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":12,"disengage":9,"casting":7},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Glass Blade","text":"Glass Blade: 2d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Step Through","text":"*Step Through*: it moves into any mirror or still water within 60 ft and out of another.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Reversed","text":"*Reversed*: left is right for it, so creatures who announce which side they're attacking from get disadvantage."},{"name":"Report","text":"*Report*: if it escapes, the mirror world knows everything it saw."}],"harvest":"Mirror-glass (a scrying focus).","role":"Scout","wants":"To report home.","tactics":"Spies, then runs through a mirror.","tell":"your reflection blinks late.","exploit":"cover the mirrors.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":220},{"id":"wayfarer-merchant","name":"Wayfarer Merchant","kr":12,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A many-armed traveller with a cart that's bigger on the inside. It sells things from other worlds, at prices that aren't in money.","hp":100,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":8,"dex":6,"con":7,"int":3,"wis":4,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":10,"casting":6},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Walking Stick ×4, 1d8 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Item from the Cart","text":"*Item from the Cart*: it pulls out a random magical item and uses it.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Merchant's Law","text":"*Merchant's Law*: it never attacks first."},{"name":"Bigger Inside","text":"*Bigger Inside*: its cart is a small planar shop."},{"name":"Leave","text":"*Leave*: if it drops below half HP, it goes home, taking the cart."}],"harvest":"Robbing it gets you whatever was in the cart, and a curse.","role":"Trader","wants":"Interesting payments: a memory, a name, a year.","tactics":"Trades. Only fights thieves.","tell":"a bell, and a cart where no road goes.","exploit":"read the small print.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":221},{"id":"gatewarden","name":"Gatewarden","kr":17,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Construct, planar","tags":["planar"],"type":"Construct","description":"A tall stone figure with a door for a chest. It guards a crossing between worlds and asks everyone the same question.","hp":145,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":5,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":16,"con":3,"int":8,"wis":5,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":18,"disengage":16,"casting":6},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Stone Fist ×2, 2d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Send Away","text":"*Send Away* (2-turn recharge): a creature it hits makes a CHA save or is sent through its chest-door to another world (the GM's choice), returning in 1d4 rounds.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Construct","text":"*Construct*."},{"name":"The Question","text":"*The Question*: it asks \"Where are you going?\" Anyone with an honest answer can pass."}],"harvest":"The chest-door (a portal, if you know how to set it).","role":"Defender","wants":"An honest answer.","tactics":"It only fights liars.","tell":"\"Where are you going?\"","exploit":"know where you're going.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":222},{"id":"inverted-knight","name":"Inverted Knight","kr":24,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A knight from a world where up is down. She stands on the ceiling and fights from there, and her gravity pulls you up with her.","hp":200,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":5,"speed":"30 ft (on any surface)","stats":{"str":5,"dex":8,"con":5,"int":12,"wis":8,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":11,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Longsword ×2, 2d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Invert","text":"*Invert* (2-turn recharge): everyone within 20 ft falls upwards to the ceiling (2d6) and stands there until the end of their next turn, when they fall back down (2d6 again).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["2d6","2d6"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Upside Down","text":"*Upside Down*: she's always on the ceiling unless she's inverted someone."}],"harvest":"Her boots (walk on ceilings).","role":"Duellist","wants":"To get home. She's very confused.","tactics":"Pulls people up into her world, where she has the advantage.","tell":"dust falling upwards.","exploit":"she's lost. Help her find her way home.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":223},{"id":"seam-stalker","name":"Seam Stalker","kr":33,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A thin, folded hunter that lives in the cracks between worlds. It reaches out through the seams of a room, the corners and the joins.","hp":280,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"40 ft (through seams)","stats":{"str":5,"dex":3,"con":5,"int":6,"wis":4,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":8,"disengage":4,"casting":4},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Folded Claws ×3, 2d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Pull into the Seam","text":"*Pull into the Seam* (2-turn recharge): a creature next to a corner makes a STR save or is pulled into the space between worlds (5d10 a turn, until it escapes with a STR check).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["5d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Seamwalker","text":"*Seamwalker*: it can attack from any corner, crack or join within 60 ft. It's only fully in this world when it attacks."}],"harvest":"Seam-silk (cuts through dimensions).","role":"Solo","wants":"To pull something interesting back home.","tactics":"Strikes from corners.","tell":"the corners of the room seem too deep.","exploit":"fight it in the open. Outdoors, on flat ground, it has nowhere to hide.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":224},{"id":"skyreef-drifter","name":"Skyreef Drifter","kr":45,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar beast","tags":[],"type":"Planar beast","description":"A floating reef from another sky. It drifts over the land, raining strange spores and stranger fish.","hp":380,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":6,"speed":"fly 20 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":18,"con":2,"int":18,"wis":10,"cha":18},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":5,"dodge":20,"disengage":20,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Coral Tendrils","text":"*Coral Tendrils* (×4): reach 60 ft, 2d10 each.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"×4","damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Spore Rain","text":"*Spore Rain* (2-turn recharge): a 60 ft area, 5d10 poison, and everyone there sees other worlds (confused for 1 turn).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["5d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Ecosystem","text":"*Ecosystem*: 1d6 planar creatures (KR 3–8) live on it and defend it."},{"name":"Weak Point – Float Bladder (80 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Float Bladder (80 HP)*: breaking it brings the reef down."}],"harvest":"Sky-coral (makes things float), exotic fish.","role":"Solo","wants":"To drift.","tactics":"Drifts over towns by accident.","tell":"fish falling from the sky.","exploit":"the bladder. Or just steer it with wind magic.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Float Bladder","hp":80,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":225},{"id":"the-collector","name":"The Collector","kr":70,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A tall, polite figure with a glass case for a body, full of things. It collects specimens from every world, and you're on its list.","hp":600,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":8,"speed":"40 ft, fly 40 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":4,"con":2,"int":1,"wis":2,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":9,"disengage":5,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Specimen Pin ×3, 3d10, and the target is pinned.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Collect","text":"*Collect* (3-turn recharge): a pinned creature makes a CHA save or is shrunk and put in the case.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"The Case (Weak Point, 100 HP)","text":"*The Case (Weak Point, 100 HP)*: breaking it frees everything inside, some of whom are very grateful, and some of whom are very angry."},{"name":"Catalogue","text":"*Catalogue*: it knows every creature's weakness if it has a specimen of their kind."}],"harvest":"The contents of the case.","role":"Solo","wants":"One of everything.","tactics":"Pins and collects.","tell":"a polite card with your name on it.","exploit":"it'll trade a specimen for a rarer one.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":226},{"id":"starfall-herald","name":"Starfall Herald","kr":110,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"A being of comet-fire that rides falling stars to this world. It announces the coming of something bigger.","hp":990,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":10,"speed":"fly 90 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":3,"con":1,"int":5,"wis":3,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":8,"disengage":4,"casting":2},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Comet Spear ×2, 5d12 comet each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Starfall","text":"*Starfall* (3-turn recharge): three meteors, each a 20 ft area, 8d10 comet and fire.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":["8d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: it acts twice a round."},{"name":"Countdown (6) – The Arrival","text":"*Countdown (6) – The Arrival*: at 0, it opens the way for whatever it heralds."}],"harvest":"A starfall heart (a legendary comet core).","role":"Solo","wants":"To prepare the way.","tactics":"Rains stars while the countdown runs.","tell":"shooting stars that don't stop.","exploit":"its announcement can be interrupted. Silence it before the countdown ends.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":6,"unit":"rounds","effect":"The Arrival"}],"shifts":[]},"order":227},{"id":"the-uninvited","name":"The Uninvited","kr":170,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"Something huge pushing into the world from outside. You can see its outline pressing against the sky like a hand against a sheet.","hp":1550,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":12,"speed":"—","stats":{"str":1,"dex":20,"con":1,"int":2,"wis":2,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":20,"disengage":null,"casting":2},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Reaching Through","text":"*Reaching Through* (×4 a round): a vast limb strikes a 30 ft area, 6d12.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"×4 a round","damage":["6d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Warp","text":"*Warp* (3-turn recharge): reality bends in a 120 ft area: gravity reverses, time skips or distances change (the GM rolls).","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Set piece","text":"*Set piece*."},{"name":"Weak Points – Five Tears (300 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Five Tears (300 HP each)*: the places it's pushing through. Sealing a tear (a ritual, or 300 damage to the limb inside it) pushes it back."},{"name":"Countdown (10) – Through","text":"*Countdown (10) – Through*: at 0, it's in."}],"harvest":"A fragment of the outside (a god-tier mind core, maddening to hold).","role":"Set piece","wants":"In.","tactics":"The party seals tears while it reaches for them.","tell":"the sky looks thin.","exploit":"the Wayfarer Merchants know how to seal tears, for a price.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Five Tears","hp":300,"each":true,"count":5}],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":10,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Through"}],"shifts":[]},"order":228},{"id":"the-other-world","name":"The Other World","kr":270,"volume":2,"family":"Planar Wanderers","familyId":"planar-wanderers","typeLine":"Planar","tags":[],"type":"Planar","description":"Another world is overlapping ours. Its cities stand in our fields, its seas fill our valleys, and only one of them can stay.","hp":2500,"hpNote":null,"defence":6,"minHit":13,"speed":"—","stats":{"str":1,"dex":20,"con":1,"int":3,"wis":2,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":null,"ranged":null,"dodge":20,"disengage":null,"casting":1},"combatOrder":["casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Overlap","text":"*Overlap* (×4 a round): a 60 ft area becomes the other world (a sea, a city or a wasteland), and everything there takes 6d12 as it's displaced.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"×4 a round","damage":["6d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Defenders","text":"*Defenders*: 1d4 creatures from this family arrive each round.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d4"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Set piece","text":"*Set piece*."},{"name":"Weak Points – Six Anchors (350 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Six Anchors (350 HP each)*: points where the two worlds are pinned together. Each broken anchor separates a part of the worlds."},{"name":"Countdown (12) – Replacement","text":"*Countdown (12) – Replacement*: at 0, ours is gone and theirs remains."}],"harvest":"A key to the other world (a god-tier creation core).","role":"Set piece","wants":"To survive. The other world is dying too.","tactics":"There are people on the other side doing exactly what the party is doing.","tell":"strangers who say they've always lived here.","exploit":"work with the other side. There may be a way for both worlds to separate cleanly.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Six Anchors","hp":350,"each":true,"count":6}],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":12,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Replacement"}],"shifts":[]},"order":229},{"id":"glidedrake","name":"Glidedrake","kr":2,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake, flier","tags":["flier"],"type":"Drake","description":"A drake the size of a goose that glides from cliff to cliff and steals fish from the gulls.","hp":14,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"20 ft, fly 50 ft (glide)","stats":{"str":14,"dex":5,"con":12,"int":15,"wis":9,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":9,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 1d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Swoop","text":"*Swoop*: a gliding attack with advantage.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Glide","text":"*Glide*: it can't gain height without a cliff or a thermal."}],"harvest":"Scales (small, pretty, used in jewellery).","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Fish.","tactics":"Swoops for food, especially yours.","tell":"a screech from the cliffs.","exploit":"a fish tossed over the edge.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":230},{"id":"burrow-drake","name":"Burrow Drake","kr":4,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake","tags":[],"type":"Drake","description":"A flat, wingless drake with spade claws. It digs under farms and eats the livestock from below.","hp":34,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":2,"speed":"30 ft, burrow 20 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":12,"con":8,"int":17,"wis":10,"cha":18},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":14,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Spade Claw 1d8 and Bite 1d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8","1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Ambush from Below","text":"*Ambush from Below*: if it surfaces under a creature, that creature is knocked prone."}],"harvest":"Scales, spade claws (digging tools).","role":"Lurker","wants":"Sheep.","tactics":"Surfaces under its target.","tell":"holes in the field with no soil around them.","exploit":"stone floors.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":231},{"id":"thornback-drake","name":"Thornback Drake","kr":7,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake","tags":[],"type":"Drake","description":"A low, heavy drake with a row of thorny spines it can flick like darts.","hp":60,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":2,"speed":"35 ft","stats":{"str":8,"dex":9,"con":7,"int":17,"wis":10,"cha":17},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":8,"dodge":15,"disengage":12,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 2d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Spine Flick","text":"*Spine Flick*: range 40 ft, 1d10 ×2, +1d2 bleed.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"bleed"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Spined","text":"*Spined*: a creature that hits it with an unarmed attack takes 1d6."}],"harvest":"Spines (darts), scales.","role":"Artillery","wants":"Sun on a warm rock.","tactics":"Flicks spines, bites anyone who closes in.","tell":"it rattles its back.","exploit":"shields block the spines completely.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":232},{"id":"fen-wyrm","name":"Fen Wyrm","kr":11,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Wyrm","tags":[],"type":"Wyrm","description":"A long, legless wyrm that coils through marshes. It breathes a sweet-smelling, sleepy mist.","hp":95,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"20 ft, swim 40 ft","stats":{"str":6,"dex":9,"con":6,"int":14,"wis":8,"cha":13},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":7},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 2d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Coil","text":"Coil: 2d8 (grabbed).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Sleep Mist","text":"*Sleep Mist* (2-turn recharge): a 20 ft cone, everyone makes a CON save or is drowsy. Two failed saves in a row and they sleep.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Marsh-hidden","text":"*Marsh-hidden*."}],"harvest":"Mist gland (a sleeping draught).","role":"Controller","wants":"Something sleepy to eat.","tactics":"Mists the party, then coils whoever falls asleep.","tell":"a sweet smell over the water.","exploit":"stay moving and keep slapping each other awake.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":233},{"id":"saddle-drake","name":"Saddle Drake","kr":16,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake, flier","tags":["flier"],"type":"Drake","description":"A war-drake bred to be ridden. Wild ones are vicious; trained ones are worth a fortune.","hp":135,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":4,"speed":"40 ft, fly 70 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":6,"con":5,"int":16,"wis":8,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":8,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 2d10 and Talons 2d8.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10","2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Dive","text":"*Dive*: after 30 ft of flight, Talons deals 4d8 and knocks prone.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Tameable","text":"*Tameable*: a creature that rides it for three rounds (STR or DEX checks each round) can tame it (Beastmaster wildness 3)."}],"harvest":"A tame saddle drake is worth far more than its parts.","role":"Skirmisher","wants":"Freedom.","tactics":"Dives and climbs.","tell":"its shadow circling.","exploit":"jump on its back.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":234},{"id":"hoardcrawler","name":"Hoardcrawler","kr":23,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake","tags":[],"type":"Drake","description":"A drake that's slept on gold so long its scales have fused with coins. It's slow, heavy and armoured in treasure.","hp":195,"hpNote":null,"defence":6,"minHit":6,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":16,"con":3,"int":14,"wis":9,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":18,"disengage":17,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 3d10 and Tail 2d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10","2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Coin Shower","text":"*Coin Shower* (2-turn recharge): it shakes, everyone within 20 ft takes 3d8 and is knocked prone on the coins.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["3d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Treasure Armour","text":"*Treasure Armour*: each 50 damage it takes knocks off 1d6 gold of coins, and reduces its Defence by 1."},{"name":"Greedy","text":"*Greedy*: it won't leave its hoard."}],"harvest":"The coins, plus 1d6 × 100 gold of hoard.","role":"Defender","wants":"More gold.","tactics":"Sits on its hoard and shrugs off hits.","tell":"a hill of coins that breathes.","exploit":"it's slow. Steal from the edges.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":235},{"id":"twinflame-wyrm","name":"Twinflame Wyrm","kr":33,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Wyrm","tags":[],"type":"Wyrm","description":"A two-headed wyrm, one head breathing smoke and one breathing steam. The heads hate each other.","hp":280,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":5,"speed":"40 ft, swim 30 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":9,"con":3,"int":12,"wis":8,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":5},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite ×2 (one per head), 3d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Smoke Breath","text":"*Smoke Breath* (smoke head, 2-turn recharge): a 30 ft cone, 4d10, and the area is heavily obscured.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Steam Breath","text":"*Steam Breath* (steam head, 2-turn recharge): a 30 ft cone, 5d10 fire.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["5d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Shift (Smoke/Steam)","text":"*Shift (Smoke/Steam)*: one head leads each round."},{"name":"Weak Points – Necks (40 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Necks (40 HP each)*: cutting one removes its head's Bite and Breath."},{"name":"Rivalry","text":"*Rivalry*: if one head is cut off, the other gets advantage on attacks (it's delighted)."}],"harvest":"Smoke gland and steam gland (reagents in each flavour).","role":"Solo","wants":"Each head wants to be rid of the other.","tactics":"Blinds with smoke, scalds with steam.","tell":"the heads snap at each other before attacking.","exploit":"offer to cut off the other head. Each head will bargain.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Necks","hp":40,"each":true,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":1,"modes":["Smoke","Steam"]}]},"order":236},{"id":"echo-wyrm","name":"Echo Wyrm","kr":44,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Wyrm","tags":[],"type":"Wyrm","description":"A pale, eyeless wyrm that lives in deep canyons and speaks with the stolen voices of everyone it has eaten.","hp":370,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":6,"speed":"40 ft, climb 40 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":8,"con":2,"int":6,"wis":5,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":11,"casting":4},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 4d10 and Coil 3d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10","3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Echo Breath","text":"*Echo Breath* (2-turn recharge): a 60 ft line of sound, 6d10 echo, and everyone deafened.","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":["6d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Stolen Voices","text":"*Stolen Voices*: it can mimic any voice. Allies hearing a friend's voice call for help make a WIS save or go to it."},{"name":"Blindsight","text":"*Blindsight*: 120 ft, deaf-blind if deafened."}],"harvest":"Echo throat (a legendary echo core that can replay any voice it took).","role":"Solo","wants":"More voices.","tactics":"Lures people away with familiar voices.","tell":"someone you know calling from the canyon, someone who's dead.","exploit":"magical silence blinds it.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":237},{"id":"moltwyrm","name":"Moltwyrm","kr":62,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Wyrm","tags":[],"type":"Wyrm","description":"An old wyrm that's constantly shedding its skin. Its shed skins come alive and fight for it.","hp":520,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":8,"speed":"40 ft, burrow 20 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":10,"con":1,"int":10,"wis":6,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":15,"disengage":13,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 4d12 and Tail 3d12.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d12","3d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Shed","text":"*Shed* (when it drops below 75%, 50% and 25%): it sheds a skin, which becomes a Skin-husk (KR 15, 120 HP, Bite 2d10) and fights beside it.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"when it drops below 75%, 50% and 25%","damage":["2d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*."},{"name":"Fresh Scales","text":"*Fresh Scales*: after each Shed, its Min hit rises by 1 and it heals 30."}],"harvest":"Shed skins (light, strong armour), its true hide.","role":"Solo","wants":"To grow.","tactics":"Every Shed makes it stronger and adds an ally.","tell":"its scales flake and peel.","exploit":"burst it through each threshold in one go, so the skins drop together and can be hit with one area attack.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":238},{"id":"deepcoil-wyrm","name":"Deepcoil Wyrm","kr":90,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Wyrm","tags":[],"type":"Wyrm","description":"A wyrm as long as a river, living in the deepest lake in the world. Fishermen pray it stays asleep.","hp":760,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":9,"speed":"30 ft, swim 80 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":12,"con":1,"int":12,"wis":6,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":14,"casting":4},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 5d12 and Coil 4d12 (grabbed).","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d12","4d12"],"status":[]},{"name":"Undertow Breath","text":"*Undertow Breath* (3-turn recharge): a 90 ft cone of crushing water, 8d10, and everyone is pulled 30 ft towards it.","multiattack":false,"recharge":3,"limit":null,"damage":["8d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Solo","text":"*Solo*, Defiant 2."},{"name":"Tempo","text":"*Tempo*: it acts twice a round."},{"name":"The Deep","text":"*The Deep*: anything grabbed is pulled 60 ft under each round."}],"harvest":"Deep scales (a legendary water core, from the deep flavour).","role":"Solo","wants":"To sleep at the bottom of its lake.","tactics":"Pulls things under.","tell":"the lake goes still and black.","exploit":"it can't leave its lake. Fight it from the shore.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":239},{"id":"comet-drake","name":"Comet Drake","kr":150,"volume":2,"family":"Wyrms and Drakes","familyId":"wyrms-and-drakes","typeLine":"Drake, flier","tags":["flier"],"type":"Drake","description":"A drake born in the tail of a comet. It returns once a century to feed, and leaves a trail of fire across the sky.","hp":1350,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":11,"speed":"40 ft, fly 150 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":3,"con":1,"int":8,"wis":4,"cha":8},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":8,"disengage":4,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 4d20 and Talons ×2, 3d20 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"dam