ir Trade","text":"*Fair Trade*: everything it takes, it replaces with something."}],"harvest":"None. It can be bargained with, and knows where everything in town has gone.","role":"Nuisance","wants":"Interesting swaps.","tactics":"Swaps your keys for a spoon at the worst moment.","tell":"a spoon in your pocket.","exploit":"offer it a really good swap.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":242},{"id":"skinchanger-fox","name":"Skinchanger Fox","kr":5,"volume":2,"family":"Tricksters and Shapeshifters","familyId":"tricksters-and-shapeshifters","typeLine":"Shapeshifter","tags":[],"type":"Shapeshifter","description":"A fox that can wear the shape of anyone it's seen. It usually uses this to steal pies.","hp":40,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":0,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":12,"dex":4,"con":10,"int":8,"wis":7,"cha":5},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Bite","text":"Bite: 1d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Shift (Fox/Person)","text":"*Shift (Fox/Person)*: as a person it has their appearance and voice but none of their memories. It turns back into a fox when it takes damage."}],"harvest":"Fox pelt (a cloak that changes your face, once).","role":"Trickster","wants":"Mischief, and pies.","tactics":"Impersonates someone to get food, and bolts when caught.","tell":"the \"person\" has a fox's amber eyes.","exploit":"ask it something only the real person would know.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":0,"modes":["Fox","Person"]}]},"order":243},{"id":"the-wrong-neighbour","name":"The Wrong Neighbour","kr":9,"volume":2,"family":"Tricksters and Shapeshifters","familyId":"tricksters-and-shapeshifters","typeLine":"Shapeshifter","tags":[],"type":"Shapeshifter","description":"Someone in the village isn't who they were last week. They smile too much, and they're getting the others to smile too.","hp":80,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":1,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":8,"con":8,"int":6,"wis":6,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":12,"disengage":10,"casting":7},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Unfolded Claws ×2, 2d8 each (only once revealed).","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Charm","text":"*Charm*: a creature it talks to makes a WIS save or trusts it completely for a day.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Perfect Copy","text":"*Perfect Copy*: it has the real neighbour's face, voice and memories."},{"name":"Countdown (7 days) – Replacement","text":"*Countdown (7 days) – Replacement*: each week, it replaces someone new. The real ones are somewhere."}],"harvest":"The real neighbours, if found alive.","role":"Infiltrator","wants":"A whole village of its own kind.","tactics":"An investigation, not a fight.","tell":"a familiar face that doesn't know a local joke.","exploit":"animals hate it. The dogs bark at it.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":1,"count":7,"unit":"days","effect":"Replacement"}],"shifts":[]},"order":244},{"id":"riddle-cat","name":"Riddle-Cat","kr":14,"volume":2,"family":"Tricksters and Shapeshifters","familyId":"tricksters-and-shapeshifters","typeLine":"Fey","tags":[],"type":"Fey","description":"A huge, smiling cat that sits on bridges and asks riddles. It never lies, but it never tells the whole truth either.","hp":120,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":2,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":7,"dex":4,"con":6,"int":2,"wis":3,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":6},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 2d8 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]},{"name":"Vanish","text":"*Vanish*: it disappears, leaving only its grin, and reappears anywhere within 60 ft.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Riddle Bound","text":"*Riddle Bound*: it must let anyone who answers its riddle pass. Anyone who answers wrong must answer another."},{"name":"Truth-teller","text":"*Truth-teller*: it can't lie."}],"harvest":"None. It offers a favour to anyone who stumps it with a riddle.","role":"Gatekeeper","wants":"A riddle it can't solve.","tactics":"It isn't violent unless you try to cross without answering.","tell":"a grin before a cat.","exploit":"ask it a riddle back.","kind":"creature","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":245},{"id":"faceless-courtier","name":"Faceless Courtier","kr":21,"volume":2,"family":"Tricksters and Shapeshifters","familyId":"tricksters-and-shapeshifters","typeLine":"Shapeshifter","tags":[],"type":"Shapeshifter","description":"A smooth, featureless figure that wears stolen faces like masks. It's been at court for decades, under a dozen names.","hp":175,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":9,"dex":5,"con":7,"int":3,"wis":4,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":7,"casting":5},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Poisoned Pin ×2, 2d8, +2d2 poison.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"poison"}]},{"name":"Change Face","text":"*Change Face* (bonus): it takes the face of any humanoid it can see.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"bonus","damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Mask Collection (Weak Point, 30 HP)","text":"*Mask Collection (Weak Point, 30 HP)*: it keeps its stolen faces in a locked case. Destroying the case frees the faces