out Stalker","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"it calls up its own blizzard, whatever the weather."},{"at":"33%","text":"it can drag two creatures at once."}],"lair":"A cave above the road, full of frozen belongings. *Lair actions*: a gust of snow blinds one creature, or an icicle falls (1d10).","hook":"A merchant caravan went missing on the high road. One of them was carrying something valuable.","loot":"Snowgrin's pelt (snow camouflage, and immunity to cold weather). The caravan's goods.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":1,"modes":["Clear","Blizzard"]}]},"order":257,"builtFromId":"whiteout-stalker","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"prismeye","name":"Prismeye","kr":14,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Mirage Cat","tags":[],"type":"Boss Mirage Cat","description":"A desert cat with eyes like cut glass, so old its mirages have mirages. Caravans pay it tribute rather than fight.","hp":120,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":1,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":10,"dex":4,"con":9,"int":14,"wis":7,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":8,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws 1d8 and Bite 1d10.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d8","1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Mirage","text":"*Mirage*: four copies, not two."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Copies soak your hits.","tell":"three cats, but one set of tracks.","exploit":"follow the tracks, and tribute works.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Mirage Cat","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the copies can attack (1d8 each)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it makes a mirage of the whole party, and allies look like enemies (WIS save)."}],"lair":"A ruined oasis. *Lair actions*: a mirage of water appears (WIS save or a creature walks to it), or the heat makes everyone thirsty.","hook":"A caravan master needs to cross Prismeye's territory, and he's out of tribute.","loot":"Prismeye's eyes (two glass lenses that see through illusions). A hoard of old tribute.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":258,"builtFromId":"mirage-cat","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"blink","name":"Blink","kr":16,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Stutterling","tags":[],"type":"Boss Stutterling","description":"A Stutterling that slipped so far out of time it's now three steps out of step. There are four of it at any moment, and only one is there.","hp":132,"hpNote":null,"defence":1,"minHit":1,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":11,"dex":4,"con":9,"int":9,"wis":9,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Claw","text":"Claw: 2d8.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Stutter","text":"*Stutter*: as Stutterling, so with Boss Tempo it takes four turns a round, each repeating the one before."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Predictable, if you can count.","tell":"you've heard this before.","exploit":"move after its first turn, every round.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Stutterling","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"its repeats happen at a random target."},{"at":"33%","text":"it skips the party's turns. One creature a round makes a WIS save or loses its turn."}],"lair":"A clock tower where all the clocks run at different speeds. *Lair actions*: a creature ages a year, or a creature repeats its last action.","hook":"A town's day keeps repeating, and only the party notices.","loot":"A stutter-heart (once a day, repeat your last action as a reaction).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":259,"builtFromI