","effect":"Burst"}],"shifts":[]},"order":260,"builtFromId":"rotbell-carrier","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"lord-riposte","name":"Lord Riposte","kr":18,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Alpha Boss Springheel Duellist","tags":[],"type":"Alpha Boss Springheel Duellist","description":"The finest duelling automaton ever built, still waiting in an empty salle for a worthy opponent. It hasn't lost in three hundred years.","hp":144,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"40 ft (jump 30 ft)","stats":{"str":9,"dex":3,"con":8,"int":11,"wis":8,"cha":9},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":6,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Rapier ×2, 2d8 each, +1d2 bleed.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"bleed"}]},{"name":"Riposte","text":"*Riposte* (reaction).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":"reaction","damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Construct","text":"*Construct*."},{"name":"Spring Lunge","text":"*Spring Lunge*."},{"name":"Code Duello","text":"*Code Duello*: it fights only its chosen opponent, unless others join, and then it fights everyone at once and gets Riposte against each of them."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"It wants an honourable duel.","tell":"it salutes before each bout.","exploit":"a single duellist who yields properly is let go. Beat it in a fair fight and it serves you.","kind":"named","templates":["Alpha","Boss"],"builtFrom":"Springheel Duellist","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"it draws a second rapier (three Rapier attacks)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it Ripostes hits as well as misses."}],"lair":"A dusty fencing hall. *Lair actions*: the floor springs launch a creature 15 ft, or a mirror wall reflects and gives Lord Riposte advantage.","hook":"A noble's son challenged it for a bet. He hasn't come back, and the duel isn't over.","loot":"The Riposte rapier (a fine sword that grants a Riposte reaction once per round).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":261,"builtFromId":"springheel-duellist","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"toller-grum","name":"Toller Grum","kr":20,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Stone-tosser","tags":[],"type":"Boss Stone-tosser","description":"The biggest, oldest toll giant there is. He's been collecting tolls on the same bridge so long that the bridge is named after him.","hp":180,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":3,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":14,"con":4,"int":16,"wis":14,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":7,"dodge":17,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Club","text":"Club: 2d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Boulder","text":"*Boulder*: range 120 ft, 3d8, prone.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Toll Keeper","text":"*Toll Keeper*."},{"name":"Counting Trouble","text":"*Counting Trouble*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Boulders first, club second.","tell":"a sign reading TOL, now with a new price.","exploit":"he's being threatened by something under the bridge. Deal with it and he goes back to pies.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Stone-tosser","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"he picks up the bridge rail and swings it (a 20 ft arc, 3d10)."},{"at":"33%","text":"he starts pulling the bridge apart, and anyone on it makes a DEX save each round or falls."}],"lair":"His bridge. *Lair actions*: a plank breaks (DEX save or fall), or his three goats charge (2d6 each).","hook":"Grum's toll has gone up from a pie to a person. Something has changed.","loot":"Grum's toll chest (a century of tolls, some odd). His club (a giant-sized club, but good firewood).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":262,"builtFromId":"stone-tosser","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"greymantle","name":"Greymantle","kr":20,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Lichen Shambler","tags":[],"type":"Boss Lichen Shambler","description":"A lichen mound the size of a cottage, grown over a hundred statues that used to be people.","hp":180,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":3,"speed":"20 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":16,"con":4,"int":20,"wis":12,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":18,"disengage":17,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Crusted Slam ×2, 1d10 each. *Overgrow*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["1d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Stone Skin","text":"*Stone Skin*."},{"name":"Slow Growth","text":"*Slow Growth*: 10 HP a turn."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Slow and endless.","tell":"every statue has a look of surprise.","exploit":"fire stops its regeneration, and keeps it off you.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Lichen Shambler","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"its statues crack and lurch to life (1d4, KR 3 each)."},{"at":"33%","text":"Overgrow works on anyone it hits, moving or not."}],"lair":"A garden of grey statues. *Lair actions*: lichen spreads over one creature's feet (restrained), or a statue topples (2d10, DEX save).","hook":"A sculptor's whole garden of \"statues\" is made of missing people.","loot":"Greymantle's heart-moss (dissolves petrification). The statues can be freed with it.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":263,"builtFromId":"lichen-shambler","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"clatterfang","name":"Clatterfang","kr":22,"vo