cription":"A crab whose shell is a whole iceberg. It's frozen a fishing fleet into the harbour and it's eating the boats one at a time.","hp":230,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"30 ft, climb 30 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":14,"con":4,"int":19,"wis":12,"cha":19},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Ice Claws ×2, 2d8 cold each (grabbed). *Freeze*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Ice Shell","text":"*Ice Shell*."},{"name":"Regrow","text":"*Regrow*: 20 HP a turn in freezing water."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Fights on the ice and drags people into water.","tell":"blue shapes under the ice.","exploit":"fire.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Glacier Crab","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the harbour freezes solid, and the floor is ice (difficult terrain)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it breaks the ice under the party, dropping them into freezing water."}],"lair":"A frozen harbour. *Lair actions*: the ice cracks (DEX save or fall into water), or a frozen boat tips over.","hook":"A fishing village's whole fleet is frozen in, and winter's food is still on board.","loot":"Shiver's shell (cold-proof armour, if enchanted to stay frozen). The fleet.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":266,"builtFromId":"glacier-crab","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"whistler","name":"Whistler","kr":28,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Cloudstalker","tags":[],"type":"Boss Cloudstalker","description":"A pale sky-hunter that whistles as it dives out of the mist. Mountain shepherds tell children it's a bedtime story. It isn't.","hp":240,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"fly 70 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":5,"con":6,"int":13,"wis":6,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Talons ×2, 2d8 each. *Snatch and Climb*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Cloud-hidden","text":"*Cloud-hidden*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Strikes from the fog and drops people.","tell":"the whistle.","exploit":"a big wind or fire clears the fog.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Cloudstalker","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"it brings the fog down on the whole valley."},{"at":"33%","text":"it carries two creatures at once, and drops them from 60 ft."}],"lair":"A cloud-wrapped peak. *Lair actions*: a gust of wind (STR save or pushed 10 ft towards the edge), or the fog thickens (no one can see beyond 10 ft).","hook":"The shepherd's children have heard the whistle every night this week.","loot":"Whistler's plumes (a cloak of invisibility in fog). Its nest of stolen things, including several lost children's toys.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":267,"builtFromId":"cloudstalker","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"old-deafear","name":"Old Deafear","kr":28,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Gloomhound","tags":[],"type":"Boss Gloomhound","description":"The pack leader of the deep, scarred and half-deaf from a hundred cave-ins. It's learned to bring the ceiling down on purpose.","hp":240,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"50 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":6,"con":6,"int":15,"wis":6,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":7,"ranged":null,"dodge":11,"disengage":9,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite ×2, 2d8 each, +1d2 prone.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d8"],"status":[{"dice":"1d2","n":1,"status":"prone"}]},{"name":"Cave Howl","text":"*Cave Howl* (2-turn recharge).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Pack","text":"*Pack*: 1d4 Gloomhounds."},{"name":"Half-deaf","text":"*Half-deaf*: magical silence doesn't blind it; it has learned to smell."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Drives the party under weak ceilings.","tell":"the pack points its ears up.","exploit":"it can smell, not hear, so strong scents throw it off.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Gloomhound","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the pack howls together and a whole 40 ft area of ceiling falls."},{"at":"33%","text":"it collapses the tunnel behind the party."}],"lair":"An old mine with rotten supports. *Lair actions*: a support gives way (a 10 ft area, 2d10), or dust blinds one creature.","hook":"Miners are dying in cave-ins that don't make sense. The supports have bite marks.","loot":"Deafear's ears (a hearing horn that hears through stone). The mine's lost seam.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":268,"builtFromId":"gloomhound","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"mirebelly","name":"Mirebelly","kr":30,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Mire Gulper","tags":[],"type":"Boss Mire Gulper","description":"The oldest thing in the swamp, so fat it's become an island. People have tried to farm it.","hp":260,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":3,"speed":"20 ft, swim 40 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":14,"con":4,"int":19,"wis":11,"cha":19},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":15,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Gulp","text":"Gulp: 3d8, swallowed (2d8 acid a turn, 40 damage from inside frees them).","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d8","2d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Swamp Skin","text":"*Swamp Skin*."},{"name":"Big Belly","text":"*Big Belly*: it can hold three creatures, and isn't full until then."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Swallows three and swims off.","tell":"the island breathes.","exploit":"people swallowed can fight it from inside, and it can't stand that for long.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Mire Gulper","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"it burps a cloud of swamp gas (CON save or poisoned)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it dives, taking everyone it's swallowed under."}],"lair":"It is the lair: an island in the bog. *Lair actions*: the island heaves (DEX save or prone), or the mud mouth opens under someone (swallowed, DEX save).","hook":"A family's farm is sinking into the swamp. Their farm is on Mirebelly.","loot":"Things swallowed over centuries: old armour, coins, a crown. Mirebelly's stomach lining (a waterproof cloak for six).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":269,"builtFromId":"mire-gulper","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"sir-hollowcrest","name":"Sir Hollowcrest","kr":32,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Gravewarden Knight","tags":[],"type":"Boss Gravewarden Knight","description":"A dead knight who swore to guard her king's tomb until the king rose again. She's still waiting, and her patience is wearing thin.","hp":280,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":5,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":9,"con":5,"int":12,"wis":8,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":13,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Longsword ×2, 2d10 each. *Challenge*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Undead","text":"*Undead*."},{"name":"Shift (Guarding/Vengeful)","t