nhouse, full of masks. *Lair actions*: a mask speaks a secret about a party member, or a hidden door opens.","hook":"Two noble houses are about to go to war, and the Countess has sent each of them a letter.","loot":"Her mask collection (each face's owner can be freed). Her letters (blackmail on everyone).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":275,"builtFromId":"faceless-courtier","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"stormcaller-ash","name":"Stormcaller Ash","kr":44,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Stormherald Eagle","tags":[],"type":"Boss Stormherald Eagle","description":"A storm-eagle so old its feathers have gone white. It sits on the highest peak and calls lightning on anything that climbs.","hp":380,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"10 ft, fly 100 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":4,"con":5,"int":12,"wis":4,"cha":10},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":6,"dodge":9,"disengage":7,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Talons","text":"Talons: 3d10.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Lightning Call","text":"*Lightning Call* (2-turn recharge).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Storm-bringer","text":"*Storm-bringer*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Calls lightning from above.","tell":"thunder a turn before the bolt.","exploit":"metal rods draw the bolt away. It's old and tired, and can be bargained with by a gentle climber.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Stormherald Eagle","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"Lightning Call hits two targets."},{"at":"33%","text":"the storm is full, and lightning strikes a random creature every round."}],"lair":"The highest peak in the range. *Lair actions*: a gust (STR save or pushed 10 ft), or lightning strikes a metal object.","hook":"An old wizard wants one of Ash's white feathers for his last great spell.","loot":"White storm-feathers (legendary fletching: arrows deal +2d10 lightning).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":276,"builtFromId":"stormherald-eagle","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"briarwarden-hale","name":"Briarwarden Hale","kr":44,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Thicket Warden","tags":[],"type":"Boss Thicket Warden","description":"The oldest warden of the oldest grove. It's stood at the grove's edge so long that a village has grown up nearby, and it doesn't like it.","hp":380,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":4,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":13,"con":4,"int":12,"wis":5,"cha":12},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":16,"disengage":14,"casting":6},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Branch Fists ×2, 2d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Entangle","text":"*Entangle* (2-turn recharge).","multiattack":false,"recharge":2,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Shift (Walking/Rooted)","text":"*Shift (Walking/Rooted)*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Holds the grove's edge.","tell":"a tree that wasn't there yesterday.","exploit":"broker peace between the village and the grove. Hale wants a boundary, not a war.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Thicket Warden","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"two Thicket Wardens step out of the grove."},{"at":"33%","text":"it roots, and every tree within 60 ft lashes out (1d10 each round to everyone in reach)."}],"lair":"The edge of an ancient grove. *Lair actions*: roots erupt (restrained), or a tree drops a branch (2d10).","hook":"The village's woodcutters keep being found tied up in vines at the edge of the trees.","loot":"Hale-wood (a legendary root-school staff, given by the grove only if peace is made).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":1,"modes":["Walking","Rooted"]}]},"order":277,"builtFromId":"thicket-warden","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"the-hunger-wind","name":"The Hunger Wind","kr":46,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Locust Tide","tags":[],"type":"Boss Locust Tide","description":"A plague of locusts that rises every seven years and strips a whole region bare. This year, it's hungrier.","hp":390,"hpNote":null,"defence":0,"minHit":0,"speed":"fly 50 ft","stats":{"str":20,"dex":5,"con":5,"int":20,"wis":12,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":14,"disengage":12,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Stripping Swarm","text":"Stripping Swarm: 3d8 to everyone in its 60 ft space, blinded.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Swarm","text":"*Swarm*."},{"name":"Weak Point – The Swarm-Mother (60 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – The Swarm-Mother (60 HP)*: a locust the size of a dog somewhere in the cloud. Killing her breaks the swarm."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"It eats, and you're in the way.","tell":"the horizon goes dark at noon.","exploit":"smoke drives it off for a round. Find the mother.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Locust Tide","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the swarm splits into two (each half the HP)."},{"at":"33%","text":"the swarm-mother is visible but surrounded by a whirlwind (ranged attacks against her at disadvantage)."}],"lair":"The fields it's eating. *Lair actions*: dust and wings blind everyone for a round, or the swarm moves 60 ft.","hook":"The seventh year is here, and the harvest is three days from ready.","loot":"The swarm-mother's carapace (a talisman that keeps pests away). The harvest, saved.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"The Swarm-Mother","hp":60,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":278,"builtFromId":"locust-tide","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"the-red-dancer","name":"The Red Dancer","kr":48,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Dust Devil","tags":[],"type":"Boss Dust Devil","description":"A whirlwind of red sand that dances across the desert. Caravans say she's beautiful, right up until she picks them up.","hp":400,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"60 ft, fly 60 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":3,"con":5,"int":16,"wis":9,"cha":15},"combat":{"melee":6,"ranged":null,"dodge":8,"disengage":4,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Engulf","text":"*Engulf*: 3d10, blinded and lifted 20 ft.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Fling","text":"*Fling*: 40 ft, 3d10 on landing.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 2, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Elemental","text":"*Elemental*."},{"name":"Wind Wall","text":"*Wind Wall*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Picks up the lightest targets and throws them.","tell":"the wind suddenly drops.","exploit":"she loves music. Play for her and she dances away.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Dust Devil","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"she splits into three smaller whirlwinds (each with her full attacks at half damage)."},{"at":"33%","text":"she grows 30 ft tall, and Engulf takes three creatures at once."}],"lair":"A wide plain of red sand. *Lair actions*: a sand-squall blinds everyone, or quicksand opens under someone.","hook":"She's danced across the caravan road every day for a month. Trade has stopped.","loot":"A bottle of red sand (a legendary air reagent; it makes a small whirlwind when uncorked).","mechanics":{"w