t, for an hour a day).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":3,"part":"Horses","hp":80,"each":true,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":280,"builtFromId":"deathcart-driver","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"queen-hollow","name":"Queen Hollow","kr":60,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Hollowback Spider","tags":[],"type":"Boss Hollowback Spider","description":"A spider the size of a house, her back a hollow cathedral of egg chambers. A whole mountain's worth of spiders are her children.","hp":500,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":5,"speed":"40 ft, climb 40 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":6,"con":4,"int":13,"wis":8,"cha":16},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":6,"dodge":12,"disengage":10,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Bite 3d10, +2d2 poison, and Leg Strike 2d10. *Web Volley*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10","2d10"],"status":[{"dice":"2d2","n":2,"status":"poison"}]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Weak Point – Egg sac (100 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Egg sac (100 HP)*."},{"name":"Countdown (4) – Hatch","text":"*Countdown (4) – Hatch*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Webs and stalls for the hatch.","tell":"the back pulses faster.","exploit":"fire through the egg sac.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Hollowback Spider","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the egg sac splits, and the countdown drops to 1."},{"at":"33%","text":"she abandons her eggs and fights in a frenzy (+1d10 on every attack)."}],"lair":"A mountain hollow full of webs. *Lair actions*: a web strand drops (restrained), or the floor of web gives way (DEX save or fall 20 ft).","hook":"A mine broke into her hollow. The miners didn't come back, but the spiders are coming out.","loot":"Queen's silk (legendary rope and cloth). Her venom (a legendary poison).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":1,"part":"Egg sac","hp":100,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":4,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Hatch"}],"shifts":[]},"order":281,"builtFromId":"hollowback-spider","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"the-grey-singer","name":"The Grey Singer","kr":66,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Fogsinger","tags":[],"type":"Boss Fogsinger","description":"The oldest Fogsinger, who has sung a thousand ships onto the rocks. She keeps every sailor she takes, and they sing with her.","hp":540,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"20 ft, swim 60 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":5,"con":5,"int":7,"wis":5,"cha":3},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":8,"casting":4},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Claws ×2, 2d10 each, and Drowning Embrace 3d8. *Song*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["2d10","3d8"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Fog Cloak","text":"*Fog Cloak*."},{"name":"Weak Point – Throat (80 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Throat (80 HP)*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Sings, then drags.","tell":"fog against the wind.","exploit":"wax in the ears. The drowned sailors can be freed with their own names.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Fogsinger","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"her drowned choir rises (1d6 Drowned Walkers)."},{"at":"33%","text":"the song reaches a mile, and every ship in the bay steers for the rocks."}],"lair":"A ring of rocks covered in wrecks. *Lair actions*: a wave sweeps the deck (STR save or overboard), or the fog thickens.","hook":"A sailor's widow asks the party to bring back her husband's ring. He was taken by the Singer years ago.","loot":"The Singer's throat (a legendary mind core: charm anyone who hears you, once). The wrecks' cargo.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"p