eck":"exact"},{"id":"grinning-jack","name":"Grinning Jack","kr":70,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Hollow Smile","tags":[],"type":"Boss Hollow Smile","description":"The Hollow Smile that's been feeding on a whole city's fear for a generation. Every child in the city draws him.","hp":600,"hpNote":null,"defence":2,"minHit":4,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":5,"dex":4,"con":5,"int":5,"wis":3,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":10,"disengage":6,"casting":4},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Long Fingers ×2, reach 15 ft, 3d10 mind each. *Grin*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Fed by Fear","text":"*Fed by Fear*."},{"name":"Shrinks from Laughter","text":"*Shrinks from Laughter*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Frightens and grows.","tell":"every child draws the same smiling man.","exploit":"a festival. If the city laughs, he shrinks.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Hollow Smile","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"he steps into anyone's shadow within 300 ft."},{"at":"33%","text":"every frightened creature in the city counts towards Fed by Fear."}],"lair":"The city's nightmares (fought in a shared dream or in the dark streets). *Lair actions*: a child's laugh echoes and becomes a scream (WIS save or frightened), or the streets stretch.","hook":"The children of the city have stopped sleeping.","loot":"Jack's grin, framed (a mind-school legendary item that frightens anything that looks at it).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":285,"builtFromId":"the-hollow-smile","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"the-last-ram","name":"The Last Ram","kr":72,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Siege Walker","tags":[],"type":"Boss Siege Walker","description":"The last siege walker of a war nobody remembers, still marching on a capital that no longer exists. A new city has been built where it's heading.","hp":600,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":6,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":18,"con":2,"int":18,"wis":12,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":5,"dodge":20,"disengage":19,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","ranged","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Ram 4d10 and Stomp 3d10. *Bolt Thrower*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10","3d10"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Construct","text":"*Construct*."},{"name":"Weak Points – Six Legs (70 HP each)","text":"*Weak Points – Six Legs (70 HP each)*."},{"name":"Siege Engine","text":"*Siege Engine*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"It's marching on the city.","tell":"the slow thud.","exploit":"the crew hatch. Climb in and take the controls.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Siege Walker","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the turrets on its back wake up (two Bolt Throwers)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it charges in a straight line for the city walls (anyone in the way takes 6d10)."}],"lair":"It's on the march, and the lair is the road. *Lair actions*: a wall crumbles under the Ram's shadow, or a bolt hits a building.","hook":"It'll reach the city walls in three days, and they won't hold.","loot":"The command crown in its crew hatch (whoever wears it controls the Ram).","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Six Legs","hp":70,"each":true,"count":6}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":286,"builtFromId":"siege-walker","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"the-pale-regent","name":"The Pale Regent","kr":84,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Crypt Regent","tags":[],"type":"Boss Crypt Regent","description":"A dead queen who never stopped ruling. Her court is a city of the dead under the city of the living, and she's planning a coronation.","hp":700,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":6,"speed":"30 ft","stats":{"str":6,"dex":9,"con":4,"int":3,"wis":3,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":5,"ranged":null,"dodge":13,"disengage":11,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Sceptre","text":"Sceptre: 3d10 death. *Command*.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["3d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Spellcasting","text":"*Spellcasting*: tiers 1–7 of the death school.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Undead","text":"*Undead*."},{"name":"Court","text":"*Court*: 2d6 undead courtiers."},{"name":"Phylactery-crown (Weak Point, 100 HP)","text":"*Phylactery-crown (Weak Point, 100 HP)*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"She orders the party to kneel while her court attacks.","tell":"\"Kneel.\"","exploit":"a formal challenge to single combat must be accepted.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Crypt Regent","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"she Commands two creatures a turn."},{"at":"33%","text":"the dead of the city above begin to rise for her coronation."}],"lair":"An underground throne room. *Lair actions*: the courtiers bow and everyone must kneel (WIS save), or a tomb opens.","hook":"Graves in the city above are opening, and the bodies are walking downwards.","loot":"The Pale Crown (a legendary death core). A royal treasury, centuries old.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":287,"builtFromId":"crypt-regent","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"nobody","name":"Nobody","kr":99,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Alpha Boss Thousand-Mask","tags":[],"type":"Alpha Boss Thousand-Mask","description":"The oldest shapeshifter, so old it has no memory of being anything. It calls itself Nobody, and it's very good at being anyone.","hp":840,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":7,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":3,"dex":3,"con":3,"int":3,"wis":3,"cha":2},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":9,"disengage":6,"casting":3},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":null,"text":"It uses the attacks of its current form, +1 damage die, at its own Melee and Casting.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Shift (form)","text":"*Shift (form)*: it takes forms up to KR 50."},{"name":"Its True Shape","text":"*Its True Shape*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"It's everyone.","tell":"the same eyes in every form.","exploit":"truth-revealing magic. Remind it who it was.","kind":"named","templates":["Alpha","Boss"],"builtFrom":"Thousand-Mask","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"it takes the form of a party member, with all of their abilities."},{"at":"33%","text":"it becomes two forms at once, acting as both."}],"lair":"A hall of mirrors. *Lair actions*: a mirror shows a creature's double, who attacks it once, or every reflection moves differently.","hook":"Someone close to the party hasn't been themselves for weeks.","loot":"Nobody's true shard (a legendary mind core: take any form for a day). If it remembers itself, it may become a friend.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[{"trait":1,"modes":["form"]}]},"order":288,"builtFromId":"thousand-mask","templateCheck":["KR 99 (the templates give 100)"]},{"id":"mother-mound","name":"Mother Mound","kr":100,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Termite Colossus","tags":[],"type":"Boss Termite Colossus","description":"A termite mound as big as a castle that has walked across a desert to a river, and stopped there. The river's drying up.","hp":860,"hpNote":null,"defence":5,"minHit":7,"speed":"25 ft","stats":{"str":1,"dex":18,"con":2,"int":15,"wis":9,"cha":20},"combat":{"melee":4,"ranged":null,"dodge":20,"disengage":20,"casting":null},"combatOrder":["melee","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: Slam ×2, 4d10 each.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["4d10"],"status":[]},{"name":"Release","text":"*Release*: two termite swarms a round.","multiattack":false,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":[],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"Hive","text":"*Hive*."},{"name":"Weak Point – Queen's Chamber (160 HP)","text":"*Weak Point – Queen's Chamber (160 HP)*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"It's thirsty, not angry.","tell":"a mound that wasn't there last year.","exploit":"give it a new water source and it walks off.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Termite Colossus","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"soldier termites (Hive Guard Beetles, 1d4) come out of the breaches."},{"at":"33%","text":"the mound collapses inwards, and the fight continues inside its tunnels."}],"lair":"The mound itself. *Lair actions*: a tunnel collapses (2d10, DEX save), or the swarm surges through a passage.","hook":"The river has dried up downstream, and the farms are dying.","loot":"The queen's royal jelly (a legendary life core). Fireproof mound clay.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[{"trait":2,"part":"Queen's Chamber","hp":160,"each":false,"count":null}],"countdowns":[],"shifts":[]},"order":289,"builtFromId":"termite-colossus","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"mister-fairdeal","name":"Mister Fairdeal","kr":110,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Bargainer","tags":[],"type":"Boss Bargainer","description":"The Bargainer who made the most deals: crowns for kings, cures for plagues, and something back each time. Half the realm owes him.","hp":940,"hpNote":null,"defence":3,"minHit":7,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":4,"dex":4,"con":3,"int":1,"wis":2,"cha":1},"combat":{"me