00 HP)","text":"*The Key (Weak Point, 300 HP)*."}],"harvest":null,"role":null,"wants":null,"tactics":"Fully wound, it's a disaster.","tell":"the ticking.","exploit":"turn the key backwards. Stop the cult before it's fully wound.","kind":"named","templates":["Boss"],"builtFrom":"Mainspring Titan","phases":[{"at":"66%","text":"the clockwork constructs of its city wake (1d4 from the Clockwork family each round)."},{"at":"33%","text":"it winds itself (the countdown resets to 6 once)."}],"lair":"A sunken clockwork city. *Lair actions*: a gear turns, moving a section of floor 30 ft, or a pendulum swings (3d10 in a line).","hook":"A cult has found the key and is winding it, turn by turn, every night.","loot":"Grandfather's mainspring (a god-tier metal core). The clockwork city.","mechanics":{"weakPoints":[],"countdowns":[{"trait":2,"count":6,"unit":"rounds","effect":"Wind-down"}],"shifts":[]},"order":298,"builtFromId":"mainspring-titan","templateCheck":"exact"},{"id":"his-majesty","name":"His Majesty","kr":260,"volume":2,"family":"Named Monsters","familyId":"named","typeLine":"Boss Grand Pretender","tags":[],"type":"Boss Grand Pretender","description":"The thing on the throne of the greatest realm in the world. It's been king for fifty years, and it's about to crown its own kind as heirs to every throne.","hp":2340,"hpNote":null,"defence":4,"minHit":11,"speed":"40 ft","stats":{"str":2,"dex":3,"con":2,"int":1,"wis":1,"cha":1},"combat":{"melee":3,"ranged":null,"dodge":9,"disengage":5,"casting":2},"combatOrder":["melee","casting","dodge","disengage"],"attacks":[{"name":"Multiattack","text":"Multiattack: True Form Claws ×3, 5d12 each. *Royal Command*.","multiattack":true,"recharge":null,"limit":null,"damage":["5d12"],"status":[]}],"traits":[{"name":"Boss","text":"*Boss*: Defiant 3, Boss Tempo."},{"name":"The Throne (Weak Point)","text":"*The Throne (Weak Point)*."},{"name":"Countdown (3 sessions) – Succession","text":"*Countdown (3 sessions) – Succession*."}],"harvest":null,"r